              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جلسہ — jalsā — \"a public meeting; a rally\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کل شام میدان میں جلسہ ہو گا۔ kal shām maidān meṅ jalsā ho gā. There will be a rally on the ground tomorrow evening."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
