              "text": "ٹھکرانا — ṭhukrānā — \"to spurn; to turn down flatly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جلسے نے اس کی تجویز ٹھکرا دی۔ jalse ne us kī tajvīz ṭhukrā dī. The meeting flatly turned down his proposal."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with نے (he or she …): اس نے مشورہ ٹھکرایا, us ne mashvarā ṭhukrāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ٹھکرانا (ṭhukrānā) is built on ṭhokar, \"a kick, a blow\", which is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin ṭhokar under ṭhōkk, \"knock\", a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 5513). To push a thing away with the foot."
            }
          ]
        },
